                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any mosquito of the species Aedes albopictus (especially) or Aedes polynesiensis, native to tropical Southeast Asia, but now distributed globally. It is a potential vector for many viral pathogens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
