                                                "sense_id": "6c2cb974-6cac-3a39-9696-81cc5a96a327",
                                                "text": "Health authorities in Paris have fumigated areas of the French capital for the first time to kill disease-carrying tiger mosquitoes whose rapid advance through northern Europe is thought to have been accelerated by climate change."
                                            }
